{
  "name": "Approval · 3 Sweep",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Approval · Sweep\nRuns every minute and closes what nobody answered: one update sets every row that is still `pending` and past `expires_at` to `expired`. This is the timeout branch. It runs from the table, so it survives a restart and does not depend on a paused execution.\n\nA late click is already refused before this runs (the decision checks `expires_at` itself). The sweep makes the row say so and tells the requester once: replace **Timeout branch** with what should happen when nobody answered.\n\n`POST approval/sweep` runs it on demand.",
        "width": 700,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "7e5c36b1-88b1-4643-8962-dfd975200810",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "33e29d00-2783-4e96-8c56-1116e54a7ee2",
      "name": "Every minute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "approval/sweep",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ac2cb8b2-37f6-4390-8286-46a1523ec972",
      "name": "Or call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "webhookId": "7d47196e-5e09-4c31-8468-e428e103cfe4",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "approvalKey",
          "name": "Approval Key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const hex = () => Math.floor(Math.random() * 0x100000000).toString(16).padStart(8, '0');\nconst now = Date.now();\nreturn [{ json: { now, at: new Date(now).toISOString(), sweep_id: 'sweep-' + $execution.id + '-' + hex() + hex() } }];"
      },
      "id": "5ba3babe-8053-4899-868f-8194dde80bf8",
      "name": "Now",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "approval_requests"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "status",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "pending"
            },
            {
